# SIMULATION (model curve), NOT an observation. Kulkarni et al. (2019), MNRAS 485, L24 (arXiv:1809.06374), Fig. 1 middle panel, late-reionization ATON
#   simulation (blue; the run of Kulkarni2019_Sherwood in IGM_Emissivity): x_HI = 1 - Q_HII, the volume-averaged ionized
#   fraction; the 30 path vertices in the plotted range z = 4-12 (the figure interpolates linearly between them).
#   Q_HII = 0.5 at z = 6.92 (the text says 7.0), 0.99 at z = 5.33 (text: complete at 5.3). Vector coordinates resolve Q_HII
#   to 1e-8, so the post-overlap x_HI of 2e-5 - 4e-5 is as plotted. The same curve is drawn in Keating et al. (2020) Fig. 3.
#   Read from the published vector figure (axes calibrated on the tick marks); curve: Kulkarni2019_1809.06374/extracted/Kulkarni2019_Fig1_xHI_Sherwood.csv in the papers folder.
